  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/193) by xiota (Bitbucket: [xiota](https://bitbucket.org/xiota), GitHub: [xiota](https://github.com/xiota)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nThe following builds listed on the homepage are out of date…\n\n* Windows nightly builds: [https://github.com/aferrero2707/art-win64/releases](https://github.com/aferrero2707/art-win64/releases) \\(version 0.1/1.0\\)\n* Linux AppImages: [https://github.com/aferrero2707/art-appimage/releases](https://github.com/aferrero2707/art-appimage/releases) \\(version 1.7.1\\)\n* PPA for Ubuntu and derivatives: [https://launchpad.net/~dhor/\\+archive/ubuntu/myway](https://launchpad.net/~dhor/+archive/ubuntu/myway) \\(version 1.2\\)\n\nPerhaps they are not needed since the [downloads page](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/downloads/) contains up to date binaries for both Windows and Linux.\n\n‌\n",
